BaseConfigLib::initializeDestOps
├── given zero entries
│   └── it should return remaining data unchanged
├── given single entry with required=true
│   ├── it should write true to storage for chainId
│   └── it should return remaining calldata
├── given single entry with required=false
│   ├── it should write false to storage for chainId
│   └── it should return remaining calldata
├── given multiple entries
│   ├── it should write all entries to storage
│   └── it should return remaining calldata
└── given extra data after entries
